          "section": "Current Release — Non-functional Requirements",
          "priority": "must",
          "status": "active",
          "source": {
            "artifact": "vibe-coding-course-prd.md",
            "line": 63
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "NFR-003",
          "text": "上传接收确认应在 30 秒内返回；Agent 评分完成目标为 10 分钟内。",
          "section": "Current Release — Non-functional Requirements",
          "priority": "must",
          "status": "active",
          "source": {
            "artifact": "vibe-coding-course-prd.md",
            "line": 64
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "NFR-004",
          "text": "提交内容和评分记录应保存至课程结束后 1 年，并由教师确认删除。",
          "section": "Current Release — Non-functional Requirements",
          "priority": "must",
          "status": "active",
          "source": {
            "artifact": "vibe-coding-course-prd.md",
            "line": 65
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "REQ-001",
          "text": "插件应识别包含作业、姓名和小组信息的自然语言提交意图，并启动一次提交。",
          "section": "Current Release — Functional Requirements",
          "priority": "must",
          "status": "active",
          "source": {
            "artifact": "vibe-coding-course-prd.md",
            "line": 45
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "REQ-002",
          "text": "插件应允许学生配置课程邀请码、姓名、小组、代码目录、截图目录和项目结果目录。",
          "section": "Current Release — Functional Requirements",
          "priority": "must",
          "status": "active",
          "source": {
            "artifact": "vibe-coding-course-prd.md",
            "line": 46
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "REQ-003",
          "text": "每次提交应采集当前作业项目相关的完整 Codex 对话。",
          "section": "Current Release — Functional Requirements",
          "priority": "must",
          "status": "active",
          "source": {
            "artifact": "vibe-coding-course-prd.md",
            "line": 47
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "REQ-004",
          "text": "每次提交应按插件配置收集代码、截图和项目结果文件，并将其关联到作业、姓名和小组。",
          "section": "Current Release — Functional Requirements",
          "priority": "must",
          "status": "active",
          "source": {
            "artifact": "vibe-coding-course-prd.md",
            "line": 48
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "REQ-005",
          "text": "服务器应使用课程邀请码、课程名单以及提交中的姓名和小组校验课程归属。",
          "section": "Current Release — Functional Requirements",
          "priority": "must",
          "status": "active",
          "source": {
            "artifact": "vibe-coding-course-prd.md",
            "line": 49
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "REQ-006",
          "text": "学生修改姓名或小组后，服务器应在每次提交时重新执行校验。",
          "section": "Current Release — Functional Requirements",
          "priority": "must",
          "status": "active",
          "source": {
            "artifact": "vibe-coding-course-prd.md",
            "line": 50
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "REQ-007",
          "text": "上传成功后系统应返回接收确认，并异步执行 Agent 评分。",
          "section": "Current Release — Functional Requirements",
          "priority": "must",
          "status": "active",
          "source": {
            "artifact": "vibe-coding-course-prd.md",
            "line": 51
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "REQ-008",
          "text": "Agent 应基于需求理解、Codex 迭代过程、代码质量、最终功能、文档/展示完整性输出 A–E 等级、分维度依据和改进建议。",
          "section": "Current Release — Functional Requirements",
          "priority": "must",
          "status": "active",
          "source": {
            "artifact": "vibe-coding-course-prd.md",
            "line": 52
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "REQ-009",
          "text": "教师应能查看课程、小组、学生详情、提交材料、评分依据、建议和处理状态，并可批注及调整最终等级。",
          "section": "Current Release — Functional Requirements",
          "priority": "must",
          "status": "active",
          "source": {
            "artifact": "vibe-coding-course-prd.md",
            "line": 53
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "REQ-010",
          "text": "教师应能选择小组并生成包含项目结果、过程摘要、评分和教师批注的展示视图。",
          "section": "Current Release — Functional Requirements",
          "priority": "must",
          "status": "active",
          "source": {
            "artifact": "vibe-coding-course-prd.md",
            "line": 54
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "REQ-011",
          "text": "材料不完整时系统应允许提交进入评分，并在教师端标记缺失项。",
          "section": "Current Release — Functional Requirements",
          "priority": "must",
          "status": "active",
          "source": {
            "artifact": "vibe-coding-course-prd.md",
            "line": 55
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "REQ-012",
          "text": "Agent 评分失败时系统应自动重试一次；仍失败时应标记“评分失败”并通知教师。",
          "section": "Current Release — Functional Requirements",
          "priority": "must",
          "status": "active",
          "source": {
            "artifact": "vibe-coding-course-prd.md",
            "line": 56
          }
        }
